# LupiOS colour scheme: paper and ink, like a naturalist's sketchbook. No brand colour: emphasis is
# ink, focus and hover graphite, the selection an ink band. Red, amber and green stay (muted) for
# errors, warnings and success, because they carry meaning. Structure from KDE Breeze (LGPL-2.0-or-later).
# Palette (art/generate.mjs): paper 243,241,235 · shade 235,232,224 · graphite 85,90,87 · pencil 60,65,62 · ink 25,27,26

